cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "RecSys Auto Research KB · 推荐系统自动研究知识库"
message: "A bilingual (English/Chinese) knowledge base for recommender-system and computational-advertising auto research. If you use it in your research or agent workflows, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Haozhe
    family-names: Xing
repository-code: "https://github.com/Haozhe-Xing/fun-rec-mdbook"
url: "https://haozhe-xing.github.io/fun-rec-mdbook/"
abstract: >-
  A bilingual (English/Chinese) knowledge base for recommender systems and
  computational advertising auto research. Covers discriminative recommendation
  (retrieval, ranking, re-ranking with MMR/DPP, debiasing, cold start),
  generative recommendation (semantic IDs, HSTU, end-to-end OneRec/EGA,
  reasoning with OneRec-Think/RecZero, diffusion models), and computational
  advertising (GFP/GSP/VCG auctions, smart bidding, calibration, online
  allocation, WAND/ANN ad retrieval, data trading, anti-fraud). Every chapter
  is a citable unit with learning objectives, formula derivations, verified
  worked examples, practice problems with solutions, Common Mistakes, and FAQs.
keywords:
  - recommender systems
  - computational advertising
  - generative recommendation
  - semantic ID
  - HSTU
  - auto research
  - knowledge base
  - retrieval
  - ranking
  - auctions
